&+ \sigma_G + \frac{\tau_2^{1/2}}{\sigma _G} +  \frac{\tau_2^{-O(1)}A_L(\Omega_{c,C}(1),\Omega_{c,C}(\tau_2))^{-1}}{N} + \sigma_F.
